## Third-party code

This project vendors two libraries under `Code/src/vendor/`, both ported from
Arduino to native ESP-IDF APIs. Their register maps, frame logic and public
APIs are unchanged from upstream; only the hardware touchpoints were rewritten.

### Code/src/vendor/OpenTherm/

From https://github.com/ihormelnyk/OpenTherm — MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2023 Ihor Melnyk.

### Code/src/vendor/MCP23017/

From https://github.com/blemasle/arduino-mcp23017 — MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2017 Bertrand Lemasle.
